# Implementation Plan - UI/UX Pro Max Migration

We will revert the manual UX refinements (shadows, floating islands, and animated entrances) and implement a state-of-the-art **Technical Dashboard** design based on the **UI/UX Pro Max** skill. This shift prioritizes data visibility, technical precision (Fira Code), and a more structured, operations-focused layout.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will REVERT the current "Floating Island" layout to a more structured, **Tabular Dashboard** layout. This matches the "Data-Dense Dashboard" recommendation from the UI/UX Pro Max skill.

> [!TIP]
> We will adopt **Fira Code** for all mathematical and heading text. This creates a highly technical "Engineering" aesthetic, which is more appropriate for a complex math visualizer.

