## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npm run build` to ensure the new "Fira" font stack and dashboard layout bundle correctly.

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the layout feels "Technical" and "Structured" rather than "Immersive/Cinematic".
- Confirm that Fira Code is applied correctly to formulas.
- Verify the new transport bar provides clear feedback for step changes.
